  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You and your allies work together to hone in on enemies.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Target of Opportunity<sup>UC</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> Whenever you make an attack of opportunity due to Target of Opportunity, you add one-half your mythic tier (minimum 1) on the attack and damage roll.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-teamwork-feats#toc30\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
